  "description_text": "Discover modern San Francisco living in the heart of the vibrant Mission District! This beautifully renovated residence offers 6 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, a spacious light-filled layout with high ceilings, expansive windows, contemporary finishes, and stylish wood flooring throughout. The thoughtfully designed kitchen features sleek cabinetry, quality appliances, generous storage, and an inviting open-concept living area. Enjoy the convenience of in-unit laundry, beautifully appointed bathrooms, and comfortable living spaces designed for today's lifestyle. One of the property's standout features is access to a shared rooftop deck offering breathtaking panoramic city views, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. Ideally situated near Valencia Street's popular restaurants, trendy cafs, boutique shopping, and vibrant nightlife, with convenient access to BART, public transportation, and nearby Mission Dolores Park. This is a Five-unit multifamily offering Unit #5. Seller financing is available. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy contemporary urban living in one of San Francisco's most dynamic neighborhoods!",
